Christmas Solo is a romance, tv movie film directed by Christie Will Wolf.

2
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
Two single parents stumble into the possibility of love for Christmas, only to
discover that their daughters are embroiled in a nasty rivalry at school.

3
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:58,500
When the rivalry gets out of control, can hope and healing
lead everyone to a peaceful and merry Christmas?

